on the position of the trailed main rotor blade tip vortex with relation to the tail rotor
blade span. Section 5.5 will look at the most significant main rotor/tail rotor interaction
which occurs in quartering flight (areas 3 & 4 on figure 4.3.3). Here the effects of
variation in tail rotor blade dynamic head caused by the main rotor blade trailing tip
